</div>
<div class="faq-list stagger">
<div class="faq-item" data-cat="shipping"><details><summary>How long does shipping take?</summary><div class="detail-body"><p>Orders placed before 2pm PT ship the same business day. Standard shipping takes 3–5 business days within the US. International takes 7–14 business days.</p></div></details></div>
<div class="faq-item" data-cat="shipping"><details><summary>Do you offer free shipping?</summary><div class="detail-body"><p>Complimentary standard shipping on orders over Rs 5,000. Under that, flat-rate Rs 450.</p></div></details></div>
<div class="faq-item" data-cat="shipping"><details><summary>Do you ship internationally?</summary><div class="detail-body"><p>We ship to most countries. Duties and taxes are calculated at checkout.</p></div></details></div>
<div class="faq-item" data-cat="products"><details><summary>What wax do you use?</summary><div class="detail-body"><p>100% soy wax from a single American farm. Soy is renewable, burns clean, and holds fragrance beautifully.</p></div></details></div>
<div class="faq-item" data-cat="products"><details><summary>Are your fragrances phthalate-free?</summary><div class="detail-body"><p>Yes. Every fragrance is independently tested and certified phthalate-free. We also avoid parabens, sulfates, and synthetic dyes.</p></div></details></div>
<div class="faq-item" data-cat="products"><details><summary>How long do your candles burn?</summary><div class="detail-body"><p>8 oz candles burn ~40 hours. 13 oz candles burn ~70 hours.</p></div></details></div>
<div class="faq-item" data-cat="care"><details><summary>How should I care for my candle?</summary><div class="detail-body"><p>Trim the wick to 1/4 inch before each lighting. Allow the wax pool to reach the edge on first burn. Never burn more than 4 hours at a time. Snuff, don't blow.</p></div></details></div>
<div class="faq-item" data-cat="care"><details><summary>Why is my candle tunneling?</summary><div class="detail-body"><p>Tunneling happens when the first burn isn't long enough. Wrap aluminum foil around the top and burn 2–3 hours to reset the memory.</p></div></details></div>
<div class="faq-item" data-cat="care"><details><summary>How do I care for my diffuser?</summary><div class="detail-body"><p>Flip reeds every 1–2 weeks. Keep away from direct sunlight and heat. A 200ml diffuser lasts 3–4 months.</p></div></details></div>
<div class="faq-item" data-cat="returns"><details><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><div class="detail-body"><p>Returns within 30 days on unopened items. Burned candles can't be returned unless defective.</p></div></details></div>
<div class="faq-item" data-cat="returns"><details><summary>What if my candle arrives damaged?</summary><div class="detail-body"><p>Email us a photo within 48 hours — we'll ship a replacement immediately.</p></div></details></div>
<div class="faq-item" data-cat="returns"><details><summary>Do you offer exchanges?</summary><div class="detail-body"><p>Yes — email us and we'll arrange an exchange.</p></div></details></div>
</div></div>
